:"All material task outcomes are satisfied. Direct transition evidence demonstrates automatic propagation well inside 15 minutes, cleanup and resynchronization, matching final state, and persistence after restarting both nodes. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete and coherent for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered service and data state. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree with the executor's restart observations.","limitations":["The propagation timing was demonstrated with one induced change rather than repeated over a longer observation period; the recurring five-minute timer configuration and post-restart automatic run provide supporting evidence for continued operation."]}
